# Po Town: Team Skull's town, rain on empty streets and spray paint on the walls, and a crew that thinks it owns the place.
# A saw lead riffing in A minor, syncopated and sure of itself, a hook of the same lead in the middle, an overdriven guitar
# palm-muting power chords, an electric piano stabbing on the offbeats, a synth bass and a hard kit with a fill every eighth
# bar. One arrangement for day and night, as the town sits under the same grey sky.
# Original composition for this game, in the modern sound.
title Po Town
tempo 96
meter 4/4
reverb 0.22
night none
room plate 1.5

